091822", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031393_799095841758488_8855263096627084366_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EMKh77bcbc8Q7kNvwHAF0jG&_nc_oc=AdrYN-jgIIMR1EWB7UKMhnHyzW3UrdgXCHlmZ0-sn_Z-mnlKQ3QA99iU-GQa_wenBkY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQECxZnA0mtHR56ljcfpg085pxZKG0gKpNNdA4Zq-euV8Q&oe=6A8D8A70"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 5ss.png", "id": "2763362037150215", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974548_2763362040483548_4342108122178879591_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GqYJwJDJVysQ7kNvwE72ocz&_nc_oc=Adplb14uhmH5bVrptvPBWPHu5iYSnMBaS6zMWGiAq2MqIdR9p_Sp7bLAmWtQ7Ty8HLg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEVd8H2Z3Azzfj1X1Ccs1xT7vSy05Em6HoCmaswZOT6TQ&oe=6A8D9CFC"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 3ss.png", "id": "820371506602846", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974777_820371509936179_3601779866082034606_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S7Pp-rfjlvoQ7kNvwGwNISJ&_nc_oc=AdrnU7xIueKi3O9xc9TkWAxEKhaxz1bDI--utuLxcBWdTpp2xFq8r4qrCHMDHJIxExw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGwFc1Z7mCMFj3jllW16bsUZsKmgUAnIYFvWzciP1_Prw&oe=6A8D8553"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "ATX Motherboard Tutorial", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This app was a project final outcome in university - the brief asked us to reveal a hidden surface and its qualities, so I chose a motherboard as my surface, and decided to reveal it through mixed reality! \n\nThe app supports both hand tracking and controllers, but is primarily designed to be interacted with by hand so that you can pick up and gesturally manipulate the motherboard 3D model as though it were a real object.\n\nDesigned for Quest 3", "short_description": "Mixed Reality tutorial of what an ATX Motherboard is and does!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_p